tent': 'Doctor: Maybe we can start with your stomach. Are you experiencing any discomfort or pain in your abdomen?'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thank you.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Doctor: Ha ha, no need to thank me yet, let's just chat! Anyway, so you said you've been feeling some discomfort in your stomach? Can you tell me more about it? For example, where does it hurt, and is it constant or does it come and go?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Thank you.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Doctor: (laughs) Alright, alright! So, let's focus on that stomach discomfort. When did you first notice it, and has it changed at all in the past few days?"}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "How's your day going?"}], 'model': 'llama3-8b-8192'}}
