ig meal and all the drinks at the wedding I went to last weekend. Didn't expect it to linger this long, but it's been bothering me on and off for a few days now."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'That sucks. What have you been doing about it?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Not much, to be honest. I've just been trying to take it easy and stay off my feet when I can. Taken some ibuprofen a few times when it's gotten bad, but it doesn't seem like it's making a lot of difference."}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Sorry to hear that. Can you tell me more about the symptoms you are feeling?'}], 'model': 'llama3-8b-8192'}}
